    "summary": "Indentured Daemon Engines grants Vashtorr Lone Operative if at least one Daemon Vehicle from your army is at most 3 inches away. If an enemy within 18 inches targets him, Reorder Reality subtracts 1 from its hit roll and makes its ranged weapons Hazardous through phase end. Unholy Mechanisms adds 2 Strength to weapons carried by models of your Daemon Vehicle units within 6 inches. His hammer’s strike has 6 attacks, Strength 14, AP −3 and Damage 3. The sweep has 12 attacks, Strength 8, AP −1 and Damage 2. Both use melee range, WS 2+, Anti-Vehicle 4+ and Devastating Wounds.",
